      "id": "playstyle",
      "title": {
        "en": "Playstyle"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": {
            "en": "Notes"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "deck",
          "cards": [
            {
              "cardId": "c_1057_srt4",
              "name": "Prepare to Subdue",
              "cost": 0,
              "epiphany": {
                "level": 0,
                "name": "Prepare to Subdue",
                "text": {
                  "en": "Draw 1 Attack Card(s) of this unit. Increase Damage Amount of those cards by 40% for 1 turn."
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Yuki's Inpsiration and Flash Slash Neutral Epiphanies"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Yuki's Gimmick is all about the \"Inspiration\" Keyword\nInspiration is Activated whenever the card is Drawn through an Ability\nCard effect, Ego Skill Card Effect, Equipment Effects are all considered Abilities\nTurn draw does not count for Inspiration\nFlash Slash Epiphanies\nBecause Flash Slash at a base is a 2 cost attack before Inpsiration\nIt is able to pick up extra strong Neutral epiphanies like +3 Moral or +2 Vuln"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "ONE DAY YUKI WILL BE GOOD SURELY\nInspiration on Neutrals WHEN\n(That Yuki can actually use)"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": {
            "en": "6/17 Patch"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Nothing changed, Moral Slash is still around 2x better then any alternative\nIf anything"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "5/8 Patch"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Nothing changed, Moral Slash is still around 2x better then any alternative\nIf anything"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "2/4 Patch"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Freezing 3 got OMEGA BUFFED, so Yuki's ST damage increased alot\nTrickery 3 is also AMAZING for Yuki\nYuki's ST damage got increased ALOT\nIf the build is played well Yuki's ST damage is around 2x it used to be"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
